SEXTANT SIMULATION SCREEN v2
Simulation Engine Operational Manual
1. Purpose
The Simulation Screen is the operational environment where users select and execute controlled resilience scenarios.
It receives a selected scenario, processes system stress conditions, and prepares outputs for risk analysis.
2. Screen Overview
System Status
ONLINE
Indicates that the simulation interface is available for scenario execution.
Scenario Control
Example:
Normal Failure Cascade Reset
This represents a predefined simulation condition.
The system can later support multiple scenarios:
FX Shock
Banking Stress
Liquidity Stress
Confidence Loss
Systemic Cascade
3. System Nodes
The simulation monitors interconnected system components:
RP-04
Core Simulation Engine
Role:
Executes scenario logic
Generates simulation frames
Acts as the simulation source of truth
FX
Foreign Exchange Module
Monitors:
Currency pressure
Exchange rate stress
External financial shock impact
BANK
Banking System Module
Monitors:
Banking stability
Liquidity pressure
Counterparty risks
LIQ
Liquidity Module
Monitors:
Funding availability
Cash pressure
Market liquidity conditions
EQ
Equity Market Module
Monitors:
Market volatility
Asset price stress
Market confidence
CONF
Confidence Module
Monitors:
Institutional confidence
Sentiment pressure
Contagion effects
4. Output Panel
Current status:
Waiting...
Meaning:
No simulation has been executed
System is ready for input
After execution, this area can display:
Stability Index
Risk Score
Impact Level
Recovery Pathway
5. Risk Dashboard
Purpose:
Provides a simplified interpretation of simulation results.
Outputs:
Risk
Overall system stress assessment.
Metrics
Quantitative indicators generated from simulation results.
Insights
Explanation of system behaviour.
Recommendations
Possible resilience actions or intervention pathways.
6. FX Risk Graph
Purpose:
Visual representation of currency-related stress movement.
It helps users understand:
pressure changes
volatility
possible cascade effects
Operational Flow
Scenario Selection
        ↓
Simulation Engine
        ↓
RP-04 Processing
        ↓
System Nodes Update
        ↓
Risk Dashboard
        ↓
Analysis Output
